<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38180" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-vincio</span></b> , nxi, nctum, 4, v.
			a. (postclass.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>to bind before</i> or
				<i>in front</i>, <i>to fetter</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laqueo praevinctus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 15, 10, 2</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ferinis voluptatibus praevinctus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					19, 2, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
